WEBVTT

00:11:28.561 --> 00:11:30.538
We find that meditation allows your brain

00:11:30.562 --> 00:11:33.139
to get over the cultural ADHD
that we've been creating

00:11:33.163 --> 00:11:35.040
by trying to do multiple tasks at once

00:11:35.064 --> 00:11:37.541
and allows our brains
to focus on the task at hand.

00:11:37.565 --> 00:11:40.842
And finally, random acts of kindness
are conscious acts of kindness.

00:11:40.866 --> 00:11:43.010
We get people,
when they open up their inbox,

00:11:43.034 --> 00:11:44.344
to write one positive email

00:11:44.368 --> 00:11:47.045
praising or thanking somebody
in their support network.

00:11:47.069 --> 00:11:48.546
And by doing these activities

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:51.247
and by training your brain
just like we train our bodies,

00:11:51.271 --> 00:11:54.748
what we've found is we can reverse
the formula for happiness and success,

00:11:54.772 --> 00:11:57.475
and in doing so, not only create
ripples of positivity,

00:11:57.499 --> 00:11:58.576
but a real revolution.

00:11:58.600 --> 00:11:59.676
Thank you very much.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:00.700
(Applause)